# Auto Rank main cycle (crimes, GTA, booze, OC)
#
# The "interval" in admin (e.g. 5s) only takes effect if something CALLS this
# endpoint that often. Crontab cannot run more than once per minute.
#
# Option A — Match admin interval (e.g. 5s): use the ticker (recommended)
#   python scripts/cron-cycle-ticker.py
#   Set CRON_CYCLE_INTERVAL in .env to match admin (default 5). Run as a service
#   (see scripts/cron-cycle-ticker.service.example) so it keeps running.
#
# Option B — Crontab: runs every 60 seconds only (admin 5s will still = 60s)
#   Replace YOUR_CRON_SECRET with the value from backend/.env (CRON_SECRET).
#   Or use: * * * * * /path/to/scripts/cron-curl.sh main

# Same host (backend on port 8000), every minute (effective interval 60s):
* * * * * curl -s -X POST -H "X-Cron-Secret: YOUR_CRON_SECRET" -H "Content-Type: application/json" http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auto-rank/cron

# Or if cron runs elsewhere, call your public URL (every minute):
# * * * * * curl -s -X POST -H "X-Cron-Secret: YOUR_CRON_SECRET" -H "Content-Type: application/json" https://mafiawars.co.uk/api/auto-rank/cron
